      "offsetInSection": 2524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D9519561BFF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你是认真的？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60662F8BA4771F7684FF1F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等等！\n刚刚的构思会没办法收场的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B497B49FF01000A521A521A76846784601D4F1A6CA1529E6CD56536573A7684300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我还有另一个文案。\n虽然有点长，但你听我说说吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118FD8670953E64E004E2A658768483002000A867D7136670970B9957FFF0C4F464F60542C62118BF48BF45427300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说给我听",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF47ED96211542C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C317B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "给我看了那4只我想看的宝可梦\n就要走人，你可真坏呀。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ED96211770B4E8690A3003453EA621160F3770B76845B9D53EF68A6000A5C3189818D704EBAFF0C4F6053EF771F574F5440300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，听我道来。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E48FF0C542C621190536765300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "密阿雷有两个格斗集团。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BC6963F96F767094E244E2A683C659796C656E2300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一个是以<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004>为本宗，\n能活用刚之招式的流派，<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>组。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 2820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E004E2A662F4EE500100002010200044E3A672C5B97FF0C000A80FD6D3B7528521A4E4B62DB5F0F76846D416D3EFF0C00100002018B00017EC4300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "另一个是以<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005>为本宗，\n能活用柔之招式的流派，<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>团。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E64E004E2A662F4EE500100002010200054E3A672C5B97FF0C000A80FD6D3B752867D44E4B62DB5F0F76846D416D3EFF0C001000020100000056E2300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了追求强大，两个流派\n除了比赛之外，不得往来。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E868FFD6C425F3A5927FF0C4E244E2A6D416D3E000A96644E866BD48D5B4E4B5916FF0C4E0D5F975F806765300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如有往来，就要与<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>组\n和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>团的所有宝可梦为敌。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n触犯这条戒律，会让今后的生活无比艰难。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "598267095F806765FF0C5C3189814E0E00100002018B00017EC4000A548C001000020100000056E27684624067095B9D53EF68A64E3A654C300200100001BE00000A89E672AF8FD9676162125F8BFF0C4F1A8BA94ECA540E7684751F6D3B65E06BD4827096BE300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "某天，<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>组和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>团\n决定分别将<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>和<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003><U+0010><U+0001>븀\n作为各自流派的代表，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n通过对战决出哪个流派更强。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 18,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67D05929FF0C00100002018B00017EC4548C001000020100000056E2000A51B35B9A5206522B5C060010000201020002548C001000020102000300100001BE00000A4F5C4E3A540481EA6D416D3E76844EE38868FF0C00100001BE00000A901A8FC75BF9621851B351FA54EA4E2A6D416D3E66F45F3A300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "输掉这场较量的流派将面临解散……\n然而成为代表的两只宝可梦存在一个问题。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F9363898FD9573A8F8391CF76846D416D3E5C0697624E3489E3656320262026000A7136800C62104E3A4EE3886876844E2453EA5B9D53EF68A65B5857284E004E2A95EE9898300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>和<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>相亲相爱，\n它们早已打破除了比赛之外<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不得相见这项戒律。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 10,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201020002548C001000020102000376F84EB276F87231FF0C000A5B834EEC65E95DF26253783496644E866BD48D5B4E4B591600100001BE00000A4E0D5F9776F889C18FD9987962125F8B300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就在比赛日的前一天晚上……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3157286BD48D5B65E57684524D4E005929665A4E0A2026202600100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>和<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>\n彼此用眼神示意后，拔腿就跑！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201020002548C0010000201020003000A5F7C6B647528773C795E793A610F540EFF0C62D4817F5C318DD1FF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一段视死如归，为爱私奔的故事就此开始。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E006BB589C66B7B59825F52FF0C4E3A723179C15954768465454E8B5C316B645F0059CB300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我没有什么恋爱经验，\n所以缺乏恋爱要素也没办法。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n不过这会是个很精彩的故事哦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116CA167094EC04E48604B72317ECF9A8CFF0C000A62404EE57F3A4E4F604B723189817D204E5F6CA1529E6CD5300200100001BE00000A4E0D8FC78FD94F1A662F4E2A5F887CBE5F69768465454E8B54E6300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……是啊",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "20262026662F554A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好！我写完后会拿去\n密阿雷出版社自荐的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 3708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597DFF01621151995B8C540E4F1A62FF53BB000A5BC6963F96F751FA7248793E81EA83507684300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我对你只有感谢！\n如果小说卖得好，我还会请你帮忙的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 3760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115BF94F6053EA6709611F8C22FF01000A5982679C5C0F8BF453565F97597DFF0C62118FD84F1A8BF74F605E2E5FD97684300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    }
  ],
